          "option_id": "671c2efe-ca4b-4033-8910-62fcce10a5d9",
          "text": "Fluoxetine",
          "is_correct": true
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "ANSWER: A Fluoxetine is FDA approved for treatment of bulimia nervosa. It should be dosed initially 20 mg daily with titration over 1 to 2 weeks to 60 mg daily as tolerated. Some patients may need to begin at a lower dose if side effects are intolerable. A maximum dose of 80 mg daily may be used in some cases.",
